      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS CHAPO (5) finished in the minor money three on end before opening winning account with a deserved win last time, scoring at this track over 300m (17.06). The hardest to beat again. CONNECTOR (7) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 2.25 lengths (17.09) at this track in a TG1-4W over 300m. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Hard to beat again. PHYLLOXERA FURY (2) comes off an average performance last start when fifth at this track over 300m behind No Fizzy Drink (17.32) in a Grade 6. Placed at his previous run. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Likely to play a prominent role. ADA BLAZE (4) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
